{"id":"b8aa213925c24f0b32415242b9da3271d49a304b","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1233046","title":"不是吧，说好的周一重置呢， 这会又重置了","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"imqiyue","excerpt":"OpenAI - @imqiyue - 如题，才登了 40% 啊","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Wrapper\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>如题，才登了 40% 啊</p></div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/重置\"><li></li> 重置</a><a href=\"/tag/周一\"><li></li> 周一</a><a href=\"/tag/进度\"><li></li> 进度</a></P><p><span>23 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-08-09 23:45:54 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17953547\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/d2b2cfbfc17cfe674130340f9ff91b79?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"imqiyue\" data-uid=\"615716\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/imqiyue\">imqiyue</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-09 16:02:57 +08:00\">22h 29m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>昨晚刚正常周重置完，这蹬的没有重置的速度快</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17953603\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f6af/cfe7/568665_normal.png?m=1761731870\" alt=\"yangxj96\" data-uid=\"568665\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yangxj96\">yangxj96</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-09 16:42:14 +08:00\">21h 50m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>8 月 9 日凌晨 也就是今天凌晨才重置了一次,周一确定还重置么. 还是就是说的这次?</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17953626\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/eae7dc88afa03c0297eea64a402b537d?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"thedog\" data-uid=\"118511\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/thedog\">thedog</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-09 16:57:13 +08:00\">21h 35m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>什么时候重置的？我没有啊</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17953627\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/eae7dc88afa03c0297eea64a402b537d?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"thedog\" data-uid=\"118511\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/thedog\">thedog</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-09 16:57:45 +08:00\">21h 35m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>16 点重置的吗？我没轮到啊</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17953637\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8ece/c5b5/832294_normal.png?m=1785504091\" alt=\"RRWD\" data-uid=\"832294\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/RRWD\">RRWD</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-09 17:05:21 +08:00\">21h 27m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>有没有感觉重置后，感觉缩水严重，我怎么对话两轮就 40%没了，是不是营销噱头啊。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17953639\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f6af/cfe7/568665_normal.png?m=1761731870\" alt=\"yangxj96\" data-uid=\"568665\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yangxj96\">yangxj96</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-09 17:05:38 +08:00\">21h 27m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/thedog\">thedog</a> #7 今天凌晨四点左右的时候吧 我用着用着看到重置了. 今天又看到别人说周一还要重置</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17953679\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/d2b2cfbfc17cfe674130340f9ff91b79?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"imqiyue\" data-uid=\"615716\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/imqiyue\">imqiyue</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-09 17:35:47 +08:00\">20h 57m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/yangxj96\">yangxj96</a> 我三点多开始蹬的，刷新看额度还剩 60% 多，然后发帖前刷新额度变 100% 了，但我去 x 上没有看到他说有重置，不知道是什么情况。难道我眼花了？在蹬之前，我还特意重启了 codexbar 插件，并刷新了很多次</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17953771\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d32a/2455/365515_normal.png?m=1781029422\" alt=\"honjow\" data-uid=\"365515\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/honjow\">honjow</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-09 18:55:46 +08:00\">19h 37m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>最近的一次非自然重置是凌晨 4 点 33,所以你确定刚重置了吗。。你看下你的下次自然重置时间</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17953842\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/8a77c8fa7692bc598e917431c89046ef?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"h2mpz\" data-uid=\"636359\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/h2mpz\">h2mpz</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-09 19:54:20 +08:00\">18h 38m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>等了好久了这次</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17953862\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/11822edc4b3c35c89dfd3b833f45b426?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"foryou2023\" data-uid=\"626307\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/foryou2023\">foryou2023</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-09 20:10:47 +08:00\">18h 22m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>这样不会很累么？ 5 小时的额度不用完就难受，恨不得睡觉觉得亏麻了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17953884\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/d2b2cfbfc17cfe674130340f9ff91b79?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"imqiyue\" data-uid=\"615716\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/imqiyue\">imqiyue</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-09 20:25:19 +08:00\">18h 7m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/honjow\">honjow</a> 应该是没有记错的，昨晚在九点四十多重置了正常的周额度，然后一直蹬到凌晨两点左右，我记得周额度还有 80% 左右，然后下午三点多开始继续蹬，刚开始刷新额度提示网络请求异常，然后重启 codexbar 插件，网络恢复正常，并尝试多次刷新额度，见已经恢复正常后就继续蹬，比较印象深刻的就是看过剩余只剩 60% 多了，大约是下午四点多的时候，再看 codexbar 的周额度时，恢复到了 95%+ ，这才发帖确认的。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17953929\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d32a/2455/365515_normal.png?m=1781029422\" alt=\"honjow\" data-uid=\"365515\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/honjow\">honjow</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-09 21:00:14 +08:00\">17h 32m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/imqiyue\">imqiyue</a> #18 其实你看一下 codex 里的下次重置时间，你就知道上次实际的重置时间了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17953959\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/cf97e84a953518d3f03015c28c3ee584?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"opp\" data-uid=\"495669\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>20</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/opp\">opp</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-09 21:27:16 +08:00\">17h 5m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/honjow\">honjow</a> 这个只是上次满血后首次开始使用的时间，并不一定是上次重置时间，除非重置后马上使用，或者 Cockpit Tools 之类的工具，监控到重置就马上唤醒一次。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17953975\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9d12885de19cb15bdbe0344c6a789de1?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"BlueSkyXN\" data-uid=\"531301\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>21</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/BlueSkyXN\">BlueSkyXN</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-09 21:40:38 +08:00\">16h 52m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>连啥时候重置这种基础知识都不知道的话，尽量别发这种充满”主观“、”好心办坏事“的标题</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17954105\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e00f/8aac/294702_normal.png?m=1550751805\" alt=\"awhane\" data-uid=\"294702\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>22</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/awhane\">awhane</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-09 22:52:07 +08:00\">15h 40m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我的新号 codex 没有重置机会，苦等 3 天</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"如题，才登了 40% 啊 重置 周一 进度23 replies • 2026-08-09 23:45:54 +08:00 1 imqiyue OP 22h 29m ago 昨晚刚正常周重置完，这蹬的没有重置的速度快 6 yangxj96 21h 50m ago 8 月 9 日凌晨 也就是今天凌晨才重置了一次,周一确定还重置么. 还是就是说的这次? 7 thedog 21h 35m ago 什么时候重置的？我没有啊 8 thedog 21h 35m ago 16 点重置的吗？我没轮到啊 9 RRWD 21h 27m ago 有没有感觉重置后，感觉缩水严重，我怎么对话两轮就 40%没了，是不是营销噱头啊。 10 yangxj96 21h 27m ago @thedog #7 今天凌晨四点